Keep in mind that while reCAPTCHA can deter some automated attacks, it is not foolproof. Advanced attackers may find ways to bypass CAPTCHAs or use human-in-the-loop services. To provide a robust defense against spoofing, consider implementing additional security measures like CSRF tokens and rate limiting as mentioned earlier.

